# =====================================================================
# cstech.ai production 301 redirects (website cutover)
# Source: CS_Tech_Old_to_New_301_Redirect_Mapping.xlsx, sheet "301 Redirect Mapping",
#         rows with Recommended Action = "301 Redirect" (approved): 74 rules.
# Excluded: "Manual Review" rows (see cstech-301-pending-manual-review.htaccess),
#           "No Redirect" rows (/sitemap.xml) and the homepage.
#
# WHERE: the .htaccess in the document root of the server that serves the NEW website
#        on https://cstech.ai after cutover. Put this block ABOVE every other rewrite rule.
# Old URL matches with or without trailing slash, any letter case; query strings are kept.
# Every destination is a final page on https://cstech.ai (one hop, no chains).
# =====================================================================
# BEGIN cstech-301-redirects
